      "testable_prediction": "Federated anomaly detection with MCD-based Mahalanobis distances will sustain $>90\\%$ recall up to $15\\%$ anchor contamination, whereas standard covariance drops significantly past $2-5\\%$.",
      "caveats": "MCD computation increases memory and CPU cycles on resource-constrained IoT nodes."
    }
  ]
